# Cryptographically secure random bytes. The generic interface; each public verb delegates to the per-backend native implementation, which lives in its own file (`native/<env>/cryptography/random`). Input and output stay in the currency types.

load @cluesurf/base/code/native/cryptography/random
  find random-bytes

task bytes
  take size, like number
  like bytes
  send back
    call random-bytes
      read size
